msgid ""
"System opening (end of the previous day) + money in − money out = system "
"closing. The counts come from the first shift opened and the last shift "
"closed that day; a difference is the count minus the system balance at the "
"moment of counting."
msgstr ""
"Ouverture système (fin de la veille) + entrées − sorties = clôture système. "
"Les comptages viennent du premier service ouvert et du dernier service fermé"
" ce jour ; un écart est le comptage moins le solde système au moment du "
"comptage."

